{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":374093,\"title\":\"Glory 23: Las Vegas\",\"tagline\":\"\",\"overview\":\"Glory 23: Las Vegas was a kickboxing event held on August 7, 2015 at the Hard Rock Hotel and Casino in Las Vegas, Nevada, USA.  This event featured world title fight for the vacant Glory Welterweight Championship of Nieky Holzken vs. Raymond Daniels as headliner. Also this event featured 4-Man Middleweight Qualification Tournament for a chance to win a spot in the Glory Middleweight Contender Tournament to be held later.[18]  Glory 23 had average of 295,000 viewers on Spike TV.[19]\",\"poster\":null,\"backdrop\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"year\":2015,\"runtime\":0,\"genres\":[],\"status\":\"Released\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"countries\":[],\"budget\":0,\"revenue\":0,\"director\":\"\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":1553341,\"name\":\"Nieky Holzken\",\"character\":\"Unknown\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/vgXITys7xjSpSpNKGpvmYN6X7yJ.jpg\"},{\"id\":1553363,\"name\":\"Raymond Daniels\",\"character\":\"Unknown\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/70ikChe7mnk5z21IL5lllS0AzSq.jpg\"},{\"id\":1185666,\"name\":\"Dustin Jacoby\",\"character\":\"Unknown\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ad0o4XplfhMtwyczmM6Zfxmt1qQ.jpg\"},{\"id\":1553364,\"name\":\"Casey Greene\",\"character\":\"Unknown\",\"photo\":null}],\"similar\":[{\"id\":22271,\"title\":\"The September Sessions\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/u0kPC0ADREBAhxFMs3MZcKrDSCQ.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/wpbSJeMivkReqgxIKSe9vPvIewW.jpg\",\"rating\":8.5,\"year\":2002,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Kelly Slater, Rob Machado, and others take a trip to the coast of Sumatra, where they find themselves surfing beautiful waves, and lose the urgency they have come to live with being professionals. September Sessions documents this trip with interviews and 16mm footage of life on a once in a lifetime surftrip.\",\"genres\":[\"Documentary\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":881198,\"title\":\"Tony Hawk: Until the Wheels Fall Off\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/namFh1FM7BkCkiljALtgMXOoANI.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/bbosLXMWiM6FBvByi5rZ3SvSA5y.jpg\",\"rating\":7.7,\"year\":2022,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A wide-ranging, definitive look at Hawk’s life and iconic career, and his relationship with the sport with which he’s been synonymous for decades, featuring unprecedented access, never-before-seen footage, and interviews with Hawk and prominent figures in the sport including Stacy Peralta, Rodney Mullen, Mike McGill, Lance Mountain, Steve Caballero, Neil Blender, Andy MacDonald, Duane Peters, Sean Mortimer, and Christian Hosoi.\",\"genres\":[\"Documentary\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":40782,\"title\":\"WWE: The History Of The Intercontinental Championship\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/mEiJNVDHP7OkefAGlzvVtYz0wUj.jpg\",\"backdrop\":null,\"rating\":7.3,\"year\":2008,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"It's a WWE Championship with a rich and storied history and the biggest names in sports entertainment have worn its gold on the road to immortality. The Intercontinental Championship traced its history back to the 1970's, and has been held by current and future Hall of Fame superstars, including The Rock, Stone Cold Steve Austin, Triple H, Shawn Michaels, The Ultimate Warrior, Bret \\\"Hit Man\\\" Hart, Mr. Perfect, Eddie Guerrero, Edge, \\\"Macho Man\\\" Randy Savage, Ricky \\\"The Dragon\\\" Steamboat, and so many more. Throughout the summer, fans will vote for their favorite Intercontinental Championship matches from each decade, with the top vote-getters being collected in this 3-DVD set.\",\"genres\":[\"Documentary\",\"Action\",\"History\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":21641,\"title\":\"The Damned United\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ftlbCma6QoRiZgiflVmLuPKHrkq.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/cw8z9H963CtcqchtEEzqs3Ls1wC.jpg\",\"rating\":7.2,\"year\":2009,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Taking over Leeds United, Brian Clough's abrasive approach and his clear dislike of the players' dirty style of play make it certain there is going to be friction. Glimpses of his earlier career help explain both his hostility to previous manager Don Revie and how much he is missing right-hand man Peter Taylor.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"History\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":475996,\"title\":\"UFC Fight Night 116: Rockhold vs. Branch\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/j7L4WegfdeRRfQNiPd3ANwCD9mm.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7fQuLAMvTw6SvQad6sZGPwMJxS4.jpg\",\"rating\":7,\"year\":2017,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"UFC Fight Night 116: Rockhold vs. Branch was a mixed martial arts event produced by the Ultimate Fighting Championship held on September 16, 2017 at the PPG Paints Arena in Pittsburgh, Pennsylvania. A middleweight bout between former Strikeforce and UFC Middleweight Champion Luke Rockhold and former WSOF Middleweight and Light Heavyweight Champion David Branch headlined this event.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":860712,\"title\":\"Chasing the Line\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/hUVInPmUhzAePhn6jIeMbD1pfmL.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/4n5pu9scjolOXN1GXGYIgll8ro8.jpg\",\"rating\":7,\"year\":2021,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Barely 22, Franz Klammer finds himself at the “eye of the storm” when he shows up for the men’s downhill competition at the 1976 Winter Olympic Games. Since the previous season the charismatic newcomer has won virtually every race. The pressure from the media and the public and the hopes of an entire nation are off the scales. His sponsor is pushing him to switch equipment right before the competition, the weather is getting steadily worse, and his toughest rivals know that Franz has to do better than just a flawless run. Franz senses that he has to find his own path and that only the love of his life can give him the strength to do that. This is the most important race of his life in which he skis a line that nobody even thought was possible and which will make him to this day a legend in the sport of downhill skiing.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"History\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":476275,\"title\":\"Ferrari: Race to Immortality\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/lkN67j8e6fszSuRL7XuNMTY0oeT.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/dJ2Kx7h4SZGmgAbiNtSwbbBlpek.jpg\",\"rating\":7,\"year\":2017,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"The late 1950s were known as golden years in the world of motor racing, champions were made and lost on a Sunday, and no losses were greater than those of Enzo Ferrari’s Scuderia.  Based on Chris Nixon’s bestselling biography Mon Ami Mate, Ferrari: Race to Immortality tells the story of the loves and losses, triumphs and tragedy of a turbulent era that shook the motor racing world.\",\"genres\":[\"Documentary\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":21474,\"title\":\"Bring It On: Fight to the Finish\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/o3zsel0aCcBWgOCytyFa9FxuPTk.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/4Qj1qSBGjHKMEtKNfMM5Wqrpj9F.jpg\",\"rating\":6.8,\"year\":2009,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"When her mother falls for a wealthy man, Lina Cruz must move in with her new stepfather and transfer from an urban East Los Angeles public high school to an exclusive prep school in Malibu, where she struggles to fit in with her affluent new peers. After snooty cheerleading captain Avery blocks Lina from varsity, Lina recruits her best friends from her old school to help her whip the pathetic junior varsity cheerleading squad -- the Sea Lions -- into fighting shape.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":22273,\"title\":\"Thicker Than Water\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/q38rQXSCDPbwfgUpdy7e0hqjp7L.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/bmYs1sKOiqtQ57zJWJjsCJhmTPY.jpg\",\"rating\":6.6,\"year\":2000,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Chris Malloy, Emmett Malloy, and Jack Johnson got together to document the life and times of a pro surfer. Shot all on 16mm Film \\\"Thicker Than Water\\\" follows Rob Machado, Kelly Slater, Brad Gerlach, Shane Dorian, and others on a 18 month journey through the North Atlantic, South Pacific, and the Bay of Bengal.\",\"genres\":[\"Documentary\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":21972,\"title\":\"Like Mike\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/9HSaQmu1QwzvUE7R97RGoDqjTv5.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/lh0uM88KjXsmRzWXUGAGWJ0AOJR.jpg\",\"rating\":6.1,\"year\":2002,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Calvin and his friends, who all live in an orphanage, find old shoes with the faded letters MJ connected to a powerline. One stormy night, they go to get the shoes when Calvin and the shoes are struck by lightning. Calvin now has unbelievable basketball powers and has the chance to play for the NBA.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Family\",\"Fantasy\"],\"daysUntil\":null}],\"videos\":[{\"key\":\"RMXDhqGifE4\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"COvTRYlnD4Y\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"Jk-YnPWehrs\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"daysUntil\":null}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}